        "text_Ug383X": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Discover the Biblical inspiration behind the brand. Heavenly Essentials garments follow the Bibles instructions for heaven-approved apparel. Organic linen is an ancient miracle fiber, that contains skin healing and metaphysical properties. It is the only fabric mentioned over 100 times in the Bible. Linen is breathable, UV-protectant, highly absorbent, moisture-wicking, anti-inflammatory and anti-static. It is temperature regulating, durable & long-lasting!</p><p>In the Torah, the \"Mosaic Law\" provides clothing guidelines, most notably the prohibition of wearing garments made of mixed materials, (especially two different kinds of fibers), which contaminates the fabrics frequency and defiles the wearers energy flow and light body. </p><p>Heavenly Essentials adheres to 'Shatnez', all items made exclusively from a single material: organic flax. We offer pure linen pieces: linen fabric, linen elastic, sewn with linen thread. Not a stitch of synthetic or mixed materials!</p>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 4
