        "text_qfg7Rp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>White is all colors of the visible light spectrum combined. In Scripture, white represents purity, holiness, and renewal—a reflection of God's light. Inspired by heaven, white linen is the material for sacred garments of angels and the robes of the redeemed. Linen is specified for priestly garments, signifying Godliness and purification of the soul.</p><p>Heavenly Essentials mission is to create high frequency, heavenly clothing, and therefore do not offer any garments in the color black. Black is the absence of color, and wearing black strains the bodies bio-field and absorbs dark/negative energy and harmful EMF radiation. </p><p><strong>Our white fabrics are exclusively whitened using oxygen and are free from bleach and harmful chemicals. </strong>All colors use natural, plant-based dyes.</p>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 14
