          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The frequency (energy vibration) of linen is remarkable. Linen has the highest fabric frequency of any natural fabric, with a signature of 5,000 Mhz. Biblically, this is the spiritual-scientific reason linen robes and linen undergarments are the specific material instructed for the Priests to wear in the Temple, and the clothing of saints and angels. </p><p>According to Quantum Physics and Biochemistry, everything in the Universe is made up of atoms, which are molecules vibrating at specific measurable rates, known as frequencies. Every human being and living organism emits their own unique frequency. </p><p>The high frequency of linen serves as a biofield shield to low frequencies (demons) and helps serve as a protective barrier to the wearers aura. Linen improves wellness with wear, since the human body has a resonant frequency range of 70-100 Mhz, and the high frequency of linen transfers to the body, increasing the wearers personal frequency, energy and well-being.</p><p></p>",
